      "name": "Dashboard URL Reload",
      "description": {
        "content": "Since the Dashboard can have multiple URLs associated with it. It is possible to force a URL reload by calling an API endpoint of the Dashboard API.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "id": "3aff3fe3-3018-43fb-939e-74127c7ffc0c",
          "name": "Reloads dashboard urls",
